              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soup Loving Nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These were awesome! I did take the advice of one of the other reviewers and pre-cooked my bacon some as we prefer it crisp.",
            "datePublished": "2022-01-18T00:42:03.160Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cindy Capps Lepp"
            },
            "reviewBody": "LOVED THIS! Made exactly, but used a slightly spicier pepper. Don't overbake if you like the pepper a little crispy. TIP: Microwave your bacon for 5 minutes before you wrap the peppers....it'll crisp up faster in the oven! If your feta is really crumbly, add a tablespoon or two of cream cheese to the filling...it holds it together easier while you wrap the bacon.\nDefinitely would make this again!",
            "datePublished": "2015-01-16T15:15:42.253Z"
          },
